{"id":"wb-4-114","name":"慈云阁","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"慈云阁","text":"慈云阁位于中国河北省保定市定兴县城内，1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。\n慈云阁原称大悲阁，现存建筑为元大德十年（1306年）重建，平面近方形，面阔进深各三间，二层，歇山顶，高13.3米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%85%88%E4%BA%91%E9%98%81","revisionId":85843622,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85843622","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/343f6488e5b246e28acf5ba9.jpg","title":"定兴慈云阁.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%B4%E6%85%88%E4%BA%91%E9%98%81.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%B4%E6%85%88%E4%BA%91%E9%98%81.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Redpipe","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"该照片的内容为中国全国重点文物保护单位。编号： CNHE-312-025","width":320,"height":214}}